{"candidateAnswer":"The Thursday before 21 September, 2022, at a local culinary event.","evidence":"[D21:4 | 1:43 pm on 14 September, 2022] Nate: Hey Joanna, I'm no writer like you, but something pretty awesome happened. Last Monday I got to teach people vegan ice cream recipes on my own cooking show! It was a bit nerve-wracking to put myself out there, but it was a blast. Plus, I picked up a few new recipes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:109754cb-e82c-51ce-93ce-d9195c81c21c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e97f8e0e1ae2f474083a3d079887c70d576aff0c99a06b4a4005d1638f13d7a5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Nate attend a cooking show?","referenceAnswer":"The Monday before 14September, 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e97f8e0e1ae2f474083a3d079887c70d576aff0c99a06b4a4005d1638f13d7a5"}}]}